    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知某因果离散时间系统的差分方程",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            144,
            478,
            163
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (n + 2) - 0. 1 y (n + 1) - 0. 0 6 y (n) = 2 f (n + 2) + 0. 1 f (n + 1)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            220,
            172,
            772,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$f(n)$ 为激励， $y(n)$ 为响应",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            197,
            375,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)画出系统直接形式的流图；",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            225,
            413,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)求系统函数 $H(z)$ 及单位序列响应 $h(n)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            253,
            514,
            272
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)画出系统函数的零极点分布图，并判断系统是否稳定；",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            280,
            655,
            300
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4)已知系统零输入的初始条件 $y_{zi}(0)=1,\\quad y_{zi}(1)=0$ ，求系统 $y_{zi}(n)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            310,
            761,
            330
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5)当激励 $f(n)=(0.3)^{A}u(n)$ 时，求系统 $y_{zs}(n)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            335,
            563,
            359
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：(1) $y_{(n)} - 0.1y_{(n-1)} - 0.06y_{(n-2)} = 2f(n) + 0.1f(n-2)$",
        "bbox": [
            47,
            374,
            504,
            433
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "取中间度当 $g\\left( n\\right)$ ,使 $f\\left( n\\right)  = g\\left( n\\right)  - {0.1g}\\left( {n - 1}\\right)  - {0.06g}\\left( {n - 2}\\right)$",
        "bbox": [
            53,
            428,
            534,
            478
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (z) = \\frac {2 z ^ {2} + 0 . 1 z}{z ^ {2} - 0 . 1 z - 0 . 0 6} = \\frac {z (2 z + 0 . 1)}{(z - 0 . 3) (2 + 0 . 2)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            565,
            375,
            990,
            441
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\vert 2 \\vert y (n) = 2 g (n) + 0. 1 9 (n - 1)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            104,
            477,
            411,
            523
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {H (2)}{z} = \\frac {2 z + 0 . 1}{(2 - 0 . 3) (2 + 0 . 2)} = \\frac {\\frac {7}{5}}{z - 0 . 3} + \\frac {\\frac {3}{5}}{z + 0 . 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            560,
            445,
            937,
            510
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/f08ef224540d9f32fd7a542381caf676d635f1b0fecbe9c86b102fbb67250558.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            29,
            537,
            419,
            701
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (2) = \\frac {\\frac {7}{5} 2}{2 - 0 . 3} + \\frac {\\frac {3}{5} 2}{2 + 0 . 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            565,
            510,
            825,
            561
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore h (n) = \\left[ \\frac {7}{5} (0. 3) ^ {n} + \\frac {3}{5} (- 0. 2) ^ {n} \\right] u (n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            553,
            557,
            919,
            609
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 由H(2)表达式可知系统零点为0和-0.05，系统极点为0.3和-0.2，系统空板点图为",
        "bbox": [
            517,
            616,
            991,
            699
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) 由右点列 $y_{2i}(n)=A(0.3)^{n}+B(-0.2)^{n}$",
        "bbox": [
            17,
            709,
            429,
            757
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y _ {i} (0)} & {= A + B = 1} \\\\ {y _ {i} (1)} & {= 0. 3 A - 0. 2 B = 0} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            58,
            760,
            263,
            826
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} A = 0. 4 \\\\ B = 0. 6 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            279,
            749,
            424,
            809
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore y _ {2 i} (n) = \\left[ 0. 4 (0. 3) ^ {n} + 0. 6 (- 0. 2) ^ {n} \\right] u (n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            47,
            815,
            388,
            867
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (n) = (0. 3) ^ {n} u (n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            63,
            869,
            207,
            907
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (z) = \\frac {z}{z - 0 . 3}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            248,
            854,
            382,
            894
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
