            415,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知一 LTI 系统差分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            112,
            393,
            130
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (n + 2) - y (n + 1) + 0. 1 6 y (n) = f (n + 1) + 0. 3 f (n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            256,
            139,
            735,
            159
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 若系统因果, 试确定该系统的单位序列响应 $h(n)$ 和系统函数 $H(z)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            165,
            750,
            184
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 若系统因果, 试判断该系统是否为稳定系统? 为什么? 若系统反因果, 请在 z 平",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            193,
            851,
            212
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "面上画出其系统函数 $H(z)$ 的收敛域；",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            221,
            467,
            240
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 若系统因果, $y(-1) = 1$ , $y(-2) = 0$ , 计算该系统的零输入响应 $y_{zi}(n)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            148,
            248,
            950,
            273
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $H(z) = \\frac{y'(z)}{f'(z)} = \\frac{z + 0.3}{z^2 - z + 0.16} = \\frac{z + 0.3}{(z - 0.2)(z - 0.8)}$",
        "bbox": [
            53,
            268,
            568,
            332
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "普洱因果则 ROC 为 |z| > 0.8",
        "bbox": [
            94,
            342,
            426,
            384
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (8) = \\frac {- \\frac {5}{6}}{z - 0 . 2} + \\frac {\\frac {1 1}{6}}{z - 0 . 8}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            111,
            375,
            364,
            428
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\therefore H (z)} & {= \\left[ \\frac {- \\frac {1}{6} z}{z - 0 . 2} + \\frac {\\frac {1 1}{6} z}{z - 0 . 8} \\right] z ^ {- 1}} \\\\ {\\therefore h (n)} & {= \\left[ - \\frac {5}{6} (0. 2) ^ {n - 1} + \\frac {1 1}{6} (0. 8) ^ {n - 1} \\right] u (n - 1)} \\\\ & {= \\left[ - \\frac {2 5}{6} (0. 2) ^ {n} + \\frac {5 5}{2 4} (0. 8) ^ {n} \\right] u (n - 1)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            96,
            426,
            490,
            579
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) ROC为121>0.8 说明ROC内各\n单位圆数系统稳定\n\n紫外线反因果 则121<0.2\n不足非因果, 反因果特拍左序列",
        "bbox": [
            602,
            263,
            960,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/5c79cfa823dceb06b60c9801fccb74a3ddd9050e8e8d319fc66c6a1db34119b7.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            687,
            401,
            926,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 由H(2)极点可列",
        "bbox": [
            596,
            517,
            810,
            556
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y _ {2 i} (n)} & {= A (0. 2) ^ {n} + B (0. 8) ^ {n}} \\\\ {y _ {2 i} (- 1)} & {= y (- 1) = 5 A + \\frac {1}{4} B = 1} \\\\ {y _ {2 i} (- 2)} & {= y (- 2) = 2 5 A + \\frac {2 5}{1 6} B = 0} \\\\ {\\Rightarrow y _ {2 i} (n)} & {= \\left[ - \\frac {1}{1 5} (0. 2) ^ {n} + \\frac {1 6}{1 5} (0. 8) ^ {n} \\right] u (n)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
