    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、【2024 沈阳理工大学】",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            143,
            84,
            375,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知系统函数",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            112,
            276,
            130
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (z) = \\frac {z ^ {2} - 3 z}{z ^ {2} - 3 z + 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            408,
            138,
            589,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 对于所有收敛域求出对应的脉冲响应 $h(n)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            153,
            184,
            578,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 写出系统的差分方程;",
        "bbox": [
            153,
            211,
            395,
            231
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "（3）对因果系统，若输入 $x(n) = (-1)^n u(n)$ ，全响应 $y(n) = [2 + \\frac{4}{3}(2)^n + \\frac{2}{3}(-1)^n]$ ，求 $y(-1)$ 和 $y(-2)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            238,
            851,
            294
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $H(z) = \\frac{z(z-3)}{(z-1)(z-2)}$ 则 $\\frac{H(z)}{z} = \\frac{z-3}{(z-1)(z-2)} = \\frac{z}{z-1} + \\frac{-1}{z-2}$",
        "bbox": [
            34,
            285,
            830,
            363
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (2) = \\frac {2 8}{z - 1} + \\frac {- 8}{z - 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            352,
            668,
            403
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 若 ROC 为 |z| > 2 时\n\n若 ROC 为 |z| < 1 时\n\n若 ROC 为 |<|z|<2 时 $h(n) = [2 - (2)^n] u(n)$ $h(n) = [-2 + (2)^n] u(-n-1)$ $h(2) = 2u(n) + (2)^n u(-n-1)$",
        "bbox": [
            101,
